      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("At last, this is the entrance to the dwarven tunnels."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("All I can see are ruins and poor villages."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("The poor villagers that once lived here and traded with the dwarves are now held in slavery by the orcs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Slaves to the evil orcs? We must liberate them!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("That would not be a wise choice, for our mission is to retrieve the Sceptre of Fire. If we tarry in this place, hordes of orcs will surround us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Konrad, heed the words of Delfador. We shall return to wrest the grip of the orcs from these lands. Look — orcs are already gathering. More are surely on their way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("This does not please me, but I will listen to your advice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rider",
            text: _("Sir, I should like to scout out the path ahead. It would be disaster for us to find these doors sealed, leaving us as hunting fodder for the gathering horde."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Excellent. We must find a way underground before we are overwhelmed."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("The defense of the dwarves must have been strong. Look at those ruined towers!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The battle outside was fierce and lasted a full half-year. But, the battles inside the tunnels were worse."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: "10-18",
            y: "18-21",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("The pillars of Thunedain. He was a legendary dwarvish lord who made his last stand here. May we triumph where he fell."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("I would settle for escape, though I know not which I dread more: foul orcs or fetid caves."),
          },
        ],
      },
